---
description: dbt validation rules
globs:
  - "models/**/*.sql"
  - "models/**/*.yml"
  - "models/**/*.yaml"
---

After dbt model or YAML changes:

- Run `dbt parse --no-partial-parse` when syntax or configuration changed.
- Run scoped `dbt build --select <changed_model>+` when model logic changed.
- Run layer validation queries for staging, intermediate, and marts work.
- Add tests for primary keys, foreign keys, accepted values, important dates, and important measures where applicable.
- Explain failed validation before fixing it.
- Do not mark work complete until validation passes or the blocker is documented.
